+*   `MeshStatus`: An enum tracking the state of a chunk's mesh:
+    *   `Meshing`: Generation in progress.
+    *   `Meshed(Arc<MeshInfo>)`: Generation complete, holding a reference to the mesh data.
+    *   `Empty`: No mesh data exists.
